OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's emails to be searched in
OL,4,APalantir battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a preliminary hearing, the High
OL,7,FCourt was told Khan and more than a
OL,8,Fdozen other Mopac and Greater London
OL,9,FAuthority officials would have their
OL,10,Fdigital communications searched for
OL,11,Fanything relevant to the legal battle.
OL,13,FAnything found within text messages,
OL,14,FWhatsApp messages, and Microsoft Teams
OL,15,Fchats will disclosed to Palantir.
